{%- comment -%}
  card-collection.liquid — a collection tile with an overlay caption.

  §9.6: the caption has to stay legible over ANY image, which a photograph
  cannot guarantee on its own. The scrim's bottom stop is 0.7, not something
  softer — at 0.55 the 12px caption measured 3.60:1 against a white image and
  failed AA. The ramp is short so only the caption band darkens and the
  photograph is left alone above it.

  Callers are responsible for not linking to an empty collection. This snippet
  cannot decide that for them: `collection-list` lets a merchant point a tile
  anywhere, while `list-collections` iterates real collections and filters
  empties out before it gets here.

  Params:
    collection  (collection, optional) — real collection, when there is one
    url         (string, optional)     — overrides collection.url
    title       (string, optional)     — overrides collection.title
    text        (string, optional)     — caption second line
    image       (image, optional)      — overrides collection.featured_image
    fallback    (string, optional)     — demo asset filename
    ratio       (string, optional)     — square | portrait | landscape
    sizes       (string, optional)
    class       (string, optional)
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign card_url = url | default: collection.url | default: routes.all_products_collection_url
  assign card_title = title | default: collection.title
  assign card_image = image | default: collection.featured_image
  assign card_ratio = ratio | default: 'portrait'
  assign card_sizes = sizes | default: '(min-width: 990px) 25vw, 50vw'
-%}

<a class="collection-card media media--{{ card_ratio }} {{ class }}" href="{{ card_url }}">
  {%- render 'image-fallback',
    image: card_image,
    fallback: fallback,
    alt: card_title,
    width: 1200,
    height: 1500,
    sizes: card_sizes,
    placeholder: 'collection-1'
  -%}

  <span class="collection-card__scrim" aria-hidden="true"></span>

  <span class="collection-card__caption">
    <span class="collection-card__title h4">{{ card_title | escape }}</span>
    {%- if text != blank -%}
      <span class="collection-card__text caption">{{ text | escape }}</span>
    {%- endif -%}
  </span>
</a>
